---
args: {"units": "OperativeUnit[]", "source": "EvidenceItem"}
returns: "OperativeUnit[]"
---
For each condition and exception identify the exact duty or permission it modifies. Preserve conjunction, disjunction, nesting, negation and the scope of deadlines in the original wording. Test a case where the exception holds and a neighboring case where it does not. If grammar admits materially different readings, retain both as unresolved scope rather than choosing the simpler rewrite. Do not promote a conditional permission to an unconditional right.
